{"step_index":375,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-27T08:31:45Z","content":"All the code is in place. Here's a summary of everything implemented:\n\n---\n\n### Library\n- Imported **jsPDF 2.5.1** via CDN in `index.html`.\n\n### Export Buttons (2 locations)\n- **Header**: A `⤓ Export Audit Report` button with cyan glassmorphism styling next to `Refresh Live Data`. Exports the highest-risk conjunction as a standalone assessment report.\n- **CAM Drawer**: A matching `⤓ Export Audit Report` button below `Authorize Maneuver`. This version includes the full **Section 3: CAM** data (Δv, propulsion type, fuel cost, post-maneuver miss distance and Pc).\n\n### PDF Layout (`generateConjunctionReport`)\nThe function builds an aerospace-grade PDF using jsPDF with:\n\n- **Dark slate theme** (`#0F172A` background) with cyan (`#06B6D4`) accent lines — matches the Orbital Guard UI.\n- **Header bar**: `ORBITAL GUARD // CONJUNCTION ASSESSMENT REPORT (CAR)`, auto-generated Document ID (e.g., `CAR-2026-09-8842`), UTC generation timestamp, and a cyan `UNCLASSIFIED / OPERATIONAL BRIEF` classification badge.\n- **Section 1 — Event Summary**: Primary/Secondary objects, NORAD IDs, TCA (UTC), Miss Distance ($d$), and Collision Probability ($P_c$) in a clean label-value table.\n- **Section 2 — Risk Assessment**: Color-coded risk badge (red CRITICAL, amber MODERATE, green NOMINAL) with regulatory threshold compliance language referencing the $P_c > 1.0 \\times 10^{-4}$ actionable threshold and JSpOC/18 SPCS guidelines.\n- **Section 3 — CAM** (conditional): Only included when exported from the CAM drawer. Shows burn direction, In-Track Δv, propulsion type, propellant mass penalty, and post-maneuver estimated miss distance + status.\n- **Footer**: Formal verification notice about SGP4 propagation and 2D Gaussian B-Plane integral, certified for SSA flight dynamics handoff.\n\nThe file auto-downloads as `OrbitalGuard_CAR-2026-09-XXXX.pdf`.\n\n**Please refresh your browser at http://localhost:3000**. Click any CRITICAL row to open the CAM drawer, adjust the Δv slider, then click `⤓ Export Audit Report` to download the PDF!"}
